  "HDDS-13883": {
    "jira_id": "HDDS-13883",
    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Implemented",
    "title": "Support HTTPS with `ozone insight` command",
    "description": "The {{ozone insight}} command only supports [HTTP connections|https://github.com/apache/ozone/blob/9d6b6928a7437d344a37b74c426e1227d24d1f24/hadoop-ozone/insight/src/main/java/org/apache/hadoop/ozone/insight/BaseInsightSubCommand.java#L66]. We should add HTTPS support similar to the {{ozone admin namespace}} command, which can connect to Recon's [HTTPS endpoint|https://github.com/apache/ozone/blob/86039e8302d859d62c078ef23e01efc640397e72/hadoop-ozone/cli-admin/src/main/java/org/apache/hadoop/ozone/admin/nssummary/NSSummaryCLIUtils.java#L50] with security enabled.",
    "commits": [
      {
        "sha": "231496e515f728e45063f740acdaeb800915e60d",
        "message": "HDDS-13883. Support HTTPS with ozone insight command",
        "author": "sarvekshayr",
        "date": "2025-11-12T07:57:35Z",
        "files": [
